{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-18241-r4518359","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Bulgarian Meatball Soup (Supa Topcheta)","sourcePageId":18241,"sourceRevision":"4518359","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:26:42Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Bulgarian%20Meatball%20Soup%20(Supa%20Topcheta)&oldid=4518359","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:46.577Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Bulgarian recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for soup","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using dehydrated broth","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using green bell pepper","Category:Recipes using ground beef","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using rice","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"011ab9a13955be80caf7c57dc354e737e65934bf9e9702710bf3fcffbbf24a53","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Soup recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Supa topcheta''' is a popular Bulgarian soup.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (450 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) ground [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]] \n* 6 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]] \n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]] \n* 1 tsp dried [[Cookbook:Savory|savory]]\n* Salt to taste\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]] to taste\n* 6 cups water \n* 2 beef [[Cookbook:Bouillon Cube|bouillon cubes]]\n* ½ bunch green [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]], [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]]\n* 1 green [[Cookbook:Bell Pepper|bell pepper]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]], peeled and sliced thin\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]], peeled and chopped\n* ½ bunch [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]], [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]] \n* 1 [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]], juiced\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Combine beef, rice, paprika, and savory.\n# Season to taste with salt and pepper, and mix lightly but thoroughly.\n# Form mixture into 1-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] (2.5 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]]) balls, then roll in flour. \n# Combine water, bouillon cubes, 1 tablespoon salt, 1 teaspoon pepper, green onions, green pepper, carrots, and tomatoes in large pot. Cover, bring to [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]], reduce heat, and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] 30 minutes. \n# Add meatballs, cover, and bring to boil again. Reduce heat and simmer 20 minutes.\n# Add chiles and simmer, covered, 40 minutes or until rice is cooked. \n# Add parsley during last 5 minutes of cooking time. Taste and add more salt and pepper, if needed.\n# Just before serving, [[Cookbook:Beating|beat]] egg with lemon juice. Stir 1 to 2 tablespoons hot soup into egg mixture, then stir egg mixture into soup. \n# Heat gently, stirring, until soup is thickened slightly, but do not allow to boil.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Bulgarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green bell pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dehydrated broth]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Bulgarian Meatball Soup (Supa Topcheta)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 lb (450 g) ground beef","sourceText":"1 lb (450 g) ground beef","amountText":"1 lb (450 g) ground beef","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"6 Tbsp rice","sourceText":"6 Tbsp rice","amountText":"6 Tbsp rice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tsp paprika","sourceText":"1 tsp paprika","amountText":"1 tsp paprika","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tsp dried savory","sourceText":"1 tsp dried savory","amountText":"1 tsp dried savory","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Salt to taste","sourceText":"Salt to taste","amountText":"Salt to taste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Pepper to taste","sourceText":"Pepper to taste","amountText":"Pepper to taste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"6 cups water","sourceText":"6 cups water","amountText":"6 cups water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"2 beef bouillon cubes","sourceText":"2 beef bouillon cubes","amountText":"2 beef bouillon cubes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"½ bunch green onions, sliced","sourceText":"½ bunch green onions, sliced","amountText":"½ bunch green onions, sliced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"1 green bell pepper, chopped","sourceText":"1 green bell pepper, chopped","amountText":"1 green bell pepper, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"2 carrots, peeled and sliced thin","sourceText":"2 c